<title>JAPAN: Asahi Bank to set up Taipei, Rangoon offices.</title>
<headline>Asahi Bank to set up Taipei, Rangoon offices.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it would establish representative offices in Taipei and Rangoon on November 1.</p>
<p>The setting up of representative offices in Taiwan and Burma would help the bank offer better services to its customers, who are becoming increasingly interested in rapidly growing Asian nations, the commercial bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The establishment of the two offices would increase the number of Asahi's offices in Asian countries to 19, it said.</p>
</text>
